{"title":"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Easy_Modular_Arithmetic)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Easy Modular Arithmetic)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Easiest_Factor)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Easiest Factor)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the largest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integer</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/7/597a410326a73a9569a2da2ddfe9fe9aec737886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3+100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"16\" /> is <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Divisible\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Divisible\">divisible</a> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f2104e0af8b1c955a7bd69d4785a1e997924278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zfChnbMGLVQ?t=1458\">https://youtu.be/zfChnbMGLVQ?t=1458</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TA_Ug1-qBCU\">https://youtu.be/TA_Ug1-qBCU</a>\n</p><p>~ momeme\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r2Xpd8Dj1X8\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r2Xpd8Dj1X8</a>\n</p><p>- DARSHSHETTY4\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16a5eff7af29f3e493b3841acf8a5529318decbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10 \\mid n^3+100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def59d90948befe84e0abf48a0ca197311205a63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(n^3+100,n+10)=n+10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"243\" height=\"19\" />. Using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclidean_algorithm\" title=\"Euclidean algorithm\">Euclidean algorithm</a>, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76c870ea557a99701411239999eddc791ab5a3ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(n^3+100,n+10)= \\gcd(-10n^2+100,n+10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"392\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/0/f10c2229a6698cb06cf79efca3a5222a86a4b8f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\gcd(100n+100,n+10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aa94581dfd998781d9d86f4394190045ca1613d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\gcd(-900,n+10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f2104e0af8b1c955a7bd69d4785a1e997924278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> must divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />. The greatest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f2104e0af8b1c955a7bd69d4785a1e997924278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/9/ab95845cc47da01a4892b184d474634d108e282a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{890}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />; we can double-check manually and we find that indeed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/a/d8aa5620edbf6055c2f5d92f5e386de7ae21f895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900\\mid 890^3+100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Simple.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Simple)\">Solution 2 (Simple)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Simple)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/3/6f3566388656d86ebaf2a82886b7405f6ec5eafa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6db3324b26869b30cb5143480a46acaf6db601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=k-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"85\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c9582ce82589833ce4b09fbc1348e337bbf0fba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3+100 = k^3-30k^2+300k-900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"275\" height=\"16\" /> Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, which is largest when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e348f1272ba0360cbe2b6a3724220da4e7051c67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=900$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/e/59eaa0f8b5e30dbf56f81e3cf730b7f4703a738b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\boxed{890}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a similar manner, we can apply synthetic division. We are looking for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01abf3a3909511f61baa863898657e4cbed98c0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n^3 + 100}{n + 10} = n^2 - 10n + 100 - \\frac{900}{n + 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"291\" height=\"40\" />. Again, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/6/e16bd656179fad2c6cfedbb79070b65345de699c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n + 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> must be a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/96015ce43a29018db897ada0ab136ece84bb049b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900 \\Longrightarrow n = \\boxed{890}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The key to this problem is to realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34884c1651fb4d4fe6ab2151382a23a8ce3b560e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10 \\mid n^3 +1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"19\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Since we are asked to find the maximum possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/c/85c4755fc62797fa65228236f13ca45be329d89c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10 \\mid n^3 +100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"19\" />, we have: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d2dfa3f6390d0f3fe0193ad13811b2fa7cb431a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10 \\mid ((n^3 +1000) - (n^3 +100) \\longrightarrow n+10 \\mid 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"401\" height=\"19\" />. This is because of the property that states that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/5/045a85539fa91adb58034a22c7b1a3d3b7f4ce9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\mid b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/9/7f9b3f9149f351bc010560994e6ea81efd5122c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\mid c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9732b774e352a30b796b10911ab4148af1959c0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\mid b \\pm c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />. Since, the largest factor of 900 is itself we have: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f60cecaa54a9dcefb9a54749b6c2d9bec8164c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10=900 \\Longrightarrow \\boxed{n = 890}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"216\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~qwertysri987\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Easy_Modular_Arithmetic.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Easy_Modular_Arithmetic)\">Solution 5 (Easy Modular Arithmetic)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Easy Modular Arithmetic)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efa566252998c90686752316c09acff16e6f1221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv -10 \\pmod{n+10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/b/8bb995d0c31ca1b0ccaa08f259242e8d556db566.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 \\equiv n^3+100\\equiv(-10)^3+100=-900 \\pmod{n+10} \\Rightarrow n+10 | 900 \\Rightarrow \\max_{n+10 | n^3+100} {n} = \\boxed{890}.\\]\" width=\"687\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~asops\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Easiest_Factor.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Easiest_Factor)\">Solution 6 (Easiest Factor)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Easiest Factor)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the problem, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/8/e780a9754a031cf4536e18f901c16840fcacbe30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3 + 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> has a cube. Immediately think of sum of cubes, which leads us to add 900, resulting in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/a/07adc074a068758ebba3e2481c66b3f534183dcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n^3 + 10^3) - 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"21\" /> --&gt; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/c/19c52422aa99e9ef5403508cd6989d91f21e1387.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+10)(n^2 - 10n + 100) - 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"250\" height=\"21\" />. Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41e7504d6b8da46763154170fcdbcdb9283c6ca6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+10)(n^2 - 10n + 100)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"201\" height=\"21\" /> contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c84814f7831eb26442156c51f699da5a5fc3e3a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" />, this part is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f2104e0af8b1c955a7bd69d4785a1e997924278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> --&gt; therefore the 900 must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f2104e0af8b1c955a7bd69d4785a1e997924278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />. The largest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfies this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/a/86ac73da756106af68636d5a9de3b88cdee951db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900-10 = \\boxed{890}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"132\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME\" title=\"1986 AIME\">1986 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017175614\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 320/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8314/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.541      1 -total\n 62.25%    9.675      1 Template:AIME_box\n 34.44%    5.352      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2813:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017175614 and revision id 273779. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}